        "id": "p22-q14-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{3}{\\sqrt5-2}+\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt5+2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$5\\sqrt5+2$\n\nRationalise each denominator using its conjugate, then collect like terms.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{3}{\\sqrt5-2}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt5+2}&=\\frac{3(\\sqrt5+2)}{5-4}+\\frac{2(\\sqrt5-2)}{5-4}\\\\\\frac{3}{\\sqrt5-2}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt5+2}&=3\\sqrt5+6+2\\sqrt5-4\\\\\\frac{3}{\\sqrt5-2}+\\frac{2}{\\sqrt5+2}&=5\\sqrt5+2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 40
      },
      {
        "id": "p22-q14-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{2}{6-3\\sqrt3}-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt3+3}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac73$\n\nRationalise each denominator using its conjugate, then subtract over a common denominator.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{6-3\\sqrt3}-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt3+3}&=\\frac{2(6+3\\sqrt3)}{36-27}-\\frac{2\\sqrt3-3}{12-9}\\\\\\frac{2}{6-3\\sqrt3}-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt3+3}&=\\frac{4+2\\sqrt3}{3}-\\frac{2\\sqrt3-3}{3}\\\\\\frac{2}{6-3\\sqrt3}-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt3+3}&=\\frac{4+2\\sqrt3-2\\sqrt3+3}{3}\\\\\\frac{2}{6-3\\sqrt3}-\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt3+3}&=\\frac73\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      }
    ]
